{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-transformers","title":"图 Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-transformers","wordCount":1361,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"图-transformer\">图 Transformer</h1><p>消息传递有个根深蒂固的毛病：信息只能在邻居之间一跳一跳地爬。两个相隔十跳的节点要交互，得叠十层网络，而层一深就撞上 <a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a> 和 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">过挤压</a>。Transformer 在序列上早就证明了全局自注意力的威力——任意两个位置一步直连。把这套搬到图上，就是图 Transformer，它是 2024-2026 年图学习最活跃的方向之一。这一篇讲它如何引入全局注意力、又如何把图的结构信息喂回去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-全局自注意力-结构编码\">核心概念：全局自注意力 + 结构编码</h2><p>把 Transformer 直接套到图上有个根本困难：标准自注意力是「全连接」的，它默认每个 token 都能看到所有 token，但这样一来<strong>图的结构就完全丢失了</strong>——模型不知道哪两个节点真有边。图 Transformer 的全部技巧，都在于「保留全局交互的同时，把拓扑信息重新注入」。</p>\n<p>它一层的骨架和标准 Transformer 一样：多头自注意力 + 前馈网络 + 残差 + 层归一化。区别在于注意力分数里加进了结构信息：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>softmax</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{ij} = \\text{softmax}_j\\left( \\frac{(W_Q h_i)^\\top (W_K h_j)}{\\sqrt{d}} + b_{ij} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4761em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1778em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>结构偏置项</strong>，由节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的拓扑关系（如最短路距离）算出。正是这一项让模型在「人人可见」的同时仍知道谁离谁近。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    H[&quot;节点表示 H&quot;] --&gt; QKV[&quot;线性投影 Q K V&quot;]&#10;    SE[&quot;结构编码&lt;br/&gt;最短路/度/Laplacian PE&quot;] --&gt; BIAS[&quot;结构偏置 b_ij&quot;]&#10;    QKV --&gt; ATT[&quot;全局自注意力&lt;br/&gt;所有节点对&quot;]&#10;    BIAS --&gt; ATT&#10;    ATT --&gt; RES[&quot;残差 + LayerNorm&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt; FFN[&quot;前馈网络&quot;]&#10;    FFN --&gt; RES2[&quot;残差 + LayerNorm&quot;]&#10;    RES2 --&gt; OUT[&quot;新表示&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    H[\"节点表示 H\"] --&gt; QKV[\"线性投影 Q K V\"]\n    SE[\"结构编码&lt;br/&gt;最短路/度/Laplacian PE\"] --&gt; BIAS[\"结构偏置 b_ij\"]\n    QKV --&gt; ATT[\"全局自注意力&lt;br/&gt;所有节点对\"]\n    BIAS --&gt; ATT\n    ATT --&gt; RES[\"残差 + LayerNorm\"]\n    RES --&gt; FFN[\"前馈网络\"]\n    FFN --&gt; RES2[\"残差 + LayerNorm\"]\n    RES2 --&gt; OUT[\"新表示\"]</pre><h2 id=\"把结构喂回去-三类编码\">把结构喂回去：三类编码</h2><p>图 Transformer 的成败，几乎全押在「怎么把拓扑编码进去」上。主流有三类做法，常常组合使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码类型</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>注入位置</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拉普拉斯位置编码</td>\n<td>用 <a href=\"../foundations/spectral-methods\">拉普拉斯</a> 特征向量当位置坐标</td>\n<td>加到节点输入</td>\n<td>Graphormer/GPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度编码</td>\n<td>把节点度数嵌入成向量</td>\n<td>加到节点输入</td>\n<td>Graphormer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最短路偏置</td>\n<td>节点对最短路距离 → 偏置标量</td>\n<td>加到注意力分数</td>\n<td>Graphormer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Graphormer（2021）正是靠「度编码 + 最短路偏置 + 边编码」三件套，在分子性质预测的 OGB-LSC 大赛上夺冠，证明纯 Transformer 也能在图上做到 SOTA。拉普拉斯位置编码则直接复用了 <a href=\"../foundations/spectral-methods\">谱方法</a> 里的特征向量——低频特征向量天然刻画了节点在图上的「全局坐标」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它更抗过平滑与过挤压\">为什么它更抗过平滑与过挤压</h2><p>图 Transformer 流行的核心理由，是它从结构上绕开了消息传递的两大顽疾。</p>\n<p>对<strong>过挤压</strong>：远程节点不再需要让信息挤过狭窄的多跳路径，而是通过注意力一步直达，信息瓶颈消失。对<strong>过平滑</strong>：消息传递每层都强制邻居趋同（低通滤波），而自注意力的权重是数据驱动、可正可负的，配合残差连接，不会把所有节点推向同一个值。2025 年前后的理论工作（如对图 Transformer 的高斯过程极限分析）进一步刻画了它相比纯消息传递的表达力优势。这也是为什么需要捕捉长程依赖的任务（大分子、长链知识推理）越来越倾向图 Transformer，详见 <a href=\"../applications/molecular-science\">分子与科学应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"致命短板-平方复杂度\">致命短板：平方复杂度</h2><p>天下没有免费的午餐。全局自注意力的复杂度是节点数的平方 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——对一张百万节点的图，光注意力矩阵就要存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个数，完全不可行。这是图 Transformer 至今难以替代消息传递的根本原因，也呼应了 <a href=\"../training/scalability\">大规模图扩展</a> 一篇的核心矛盾。</p>\n<p>应对方向有几条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>稀疏注意力</strong>：只在局部邻域 + 少量全局节点上算注意力，把复杂度降到近线性。</li>\n<li><strong>混合架构（如 GraphGPS）</strong>：每层并行跑一个局部消息传递模块和一个全局注意力模块，再融合，兼顾局部归纳偏置与全局视野。</li>\n<li><strong>线性注意力 / 低秩近似</strong>：用核技巧把注意力近似成线性复杂度。</li>\n<li><strong>节点采样 / 子图化</strong>：先采样再在子图内做全注意力，与 <a href=\"../training/neighbor-sampling\">邻居采样</a> 思路相通。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>值得注意的是，2025 年也有反向的声音：有研究（如 SMPNN）指出，在大图表示学习上，用 Pre-LN 形式的可扩展消息传递配合预计算，反而能在更好扩展性的前提下超过图 Transformer——「全局注意力是否真有必要」仍是开放问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时用图-transformer\">何时用图 Transformer</h2><p>经验法则：图小到中等（几千到几万节点）、且任务依赖长程关系或全局结构 → 图 Transformer 往往值得；图巨大（百万级以上）→ 先考虑可扩展消息传递或混合架构，纯图 Transformer 多半扛不住。分子图（节点通常几十到几百个）是它的甜区，这也是它在 <a href=\"../applications/molecular-science\">分子科学</a> 大放异彩的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图 Transformer 用全局自注意力让任意两节点一步直连，绕开消息传递的局部限制。</li>\n<li>关键挑战是保留拓扑：通过拉普拉斯位置编码、度编码、最短路偏置等把结构注入注意力。</li>\n<li>它天然更抗 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">过挤压</a>（无信息瓶颈）和 <a href=\"../training/oversmoothing-depth\">过平滑</a>（注意力权重数据驱动、可为负）。</li>\n<li>致命短板是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度，需稀疏注意力、混合架构（GraphGPS）、线性近似或采样来缓解，详见 <a href=\"../training/scalability\">大规模图扩展</a>。</li>\n<li>甜区是中小图与分子图；2025 年「全局注意力是否必要」相对可扩展消息传递仍有争议。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图 Transformer","id":"图-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：全局自注意力 + 结构编码","id":"核心概念-全局自注意力-结构编码"},{"level":2,"text":"把结构喂回去：三类编码","id":"把结构喂回去-三类编码"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它更抗过平滑与过挤压","id":"为什么它更抗过平滑与过挤压"},{"level":2,"text":"致命短板：平方复杂度","id":"致命短板-平方复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"何时用图 Transformer","id":"何时用图-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GraphSAGE 与图注意力 GAT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graphsage-gat"},"next":{"title":"邻居采样与小批量训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/training/neighbor-sampling"}}